flowchart TD
    A[Developer Agent]
    B[Thin SDK + OpenTelemetry]
    C[Batched HTTPS/JSON Export]
    D[FastAPI Ingestion]
    E[(Kafka)]
    F[Trace Writer]
    G[(ClickHouse)]
    H[Trace Reconstruction]
    I{Run size / complexity}
    J[Direct Run Analysis]
    K[Bounded Read-Only Investigation]
    L[(PostgreSQL + Vector Knowledge)]
    M[LLM Debugger Investigator]
    N[Evidence Grounding]
    O[Findings / Analysis History]
    P[React Debugging UI]

    A --> B --> C --> D --> E --> F --> G --> H --> I
    I -->|Bounded| J --> M
    I -->|Large / complex| K --> M
    G --> K
    L --> K
    M --> N --> O --> L
    G --> P
    L --> P
